<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC's monthly maize estimates (July/June, million tonnes).</p>
<p>			   96/97(Apr) 96/97 (Mar)     95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 1.647     1.647	     1.671</p>
<p> Harvested crop	14.304    14.280	    12.394</p>
<p> Use on farms	   1.889     1.860	     1.975</p>
<p> Other domestic use   3.686     3.736	     2.970</p>
<p>  - incl. animal feed 2.600     2.650	     1.916</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  6.535     6.435	     6.087</p>
<p> Non-EU exports	 0.100     0.120	     0.164</p>
<p> Final stocks	   2.479     2.519	     1.647</p>
</text>
